---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Free Finance Calculators | Finance Hub" description="25+ free, accurate financial calculators for US, UK, Canada, and Australia.">
  <main class="container">
    
    <header class="hero">
      <h1>Free Finance Calculators</h1>
      <p>25+ fast, accurate, math-driven tools for your financial planning.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="grid">
      
      <!-- CATEGORY 1: TAX & LOANS -->
      <h2 class="category-title">Tax, Loans & Investing</h2>

      <a href="/tools/us-freelancer-tax-calculator" class="card"><div class="card-icon">📝</div><h2>US Freelancer Tax (1099)</h2><p>Estimate 2024 Self-Employment and Federal Income taxes.</p><span class="cta">Calculate &rarr;</span></a>
      
      <a href="/tools/us-mortgage-calculator" class="card"><div class="card-icon">🏠</div><h2>US Mortgage Calculator</h2><p>Calculate monthly payments, total interest, and amortization.</p><span class="cta">Calculate &rarr;</span></a>
      
      <a href="/tools/compound-interest-calculator" class="card"><div class="card-icon">📈</div><h2>Compound Interest</h2><p>See how your investments grow over time with compounding.</p><span class="cta">Calculate &rarr;</span></a>
      
      <a href="/tools/us-car-loan-calculator" class="card"><div class="card-icon">🚗</div><h2>US Car Loan Calculator</h2><p>Estimate monthly auto loan payments, including trade-ins.</p><span class="cta">Calculate &rarr;</span></a>
      
      <a href="/tools/salary-to-hourly-calculator" class="card"><div class="card-icon">⏱️</div><h2>Salary to Hourly</h2><p>Convert your annual salary into an hourly and monthly wage.</p><span class="cta">Calculate &rarr;</span></a>
      
      <a href="/tools/uk-stamp-duty-calculator" class="card"><div class="card-icon">🇬🇧</div><h2>UK Stamp Duty (FTB)</h2><p>Calculate your SDLT bill instantly for UK properties.</p><span class="cta">Calculate &rarr;</span></a>
      
      <a href="/tools/us-mortgage-calculator-pmi" class="card"><div class="card-icon">🏡</div><h2>Mortgage with PMI</h2><p>See your true payment, including Private Mortgage Insurance.</p><span class="cta">Calculate &rarr;</span></a>
      
      <a href="/tools/dividend-reinvestment-calculator" class="card"><div class="card-icon">💰</div><h2>Dividend Reinvestment (DRIP)</h2><p>See how reinvesting dividends can compound your wealth.</p><span class="cta">Calculate &rarr;</span></a>
      
      <a href="/tools/uk-student-loan-calculator" class="card"><div class="card-icon">🎓</div><h2>UK Student Loan (Plan 2)</h2><p>Estimate monthly repayments and take-home pay.</p><span class="cta">Calculate &rarr;</span></a>
      
      <a href="/tools/us-401k-retirement-calculator" class="card"><div class="card-icon">💼</div><h2>401(k) Retirement</h2><p>Calculate how much your 401(k) will be worth at retirement.</p><span class="cta">Calculate &rarr;</span></a>
      
      <a href="/tools/heloc-payment-calculator" class="card"><div class="card-icon">🏦</div><h2>HELOC Payment Calculator</h2><p>Estimate interest-only draw period payments.</p><span class="cta">Calculate &rarr;</span></a>
      
      <a href="/tools/us-boat-loan-calculator" class="card"><div class="card-icon">⛵</div><h2>Boat Loan Calculator</h2><p>Calculate monthly boat loan payments and interest.</p><span class="cta">Calculate &rarr;</span></a>
      
      <a href="/tools/uk-income-tax-calculator" class="card"><div class="card-icon">💷</div><h2>UK Income Tax</h2><p>Calculate take-home pay after UK income tax and NI.</p><span class="cta">Calculate &rarr;</span></a>

      <a href="/tools/canada-mortgage-calculator" class="card"><div class="card-icon">🇨🇦</div><h2>Canada Mortgage Calculator</h2><p>Estimate payments with semi-annual compounding.</p><span class="cta">Calculate &rarr;</span></a>
      
      <a href="/tools/australia-income-tax-calculator" class="card"><div class="card-icon">🇦🇺</div><h2>Australia Income Tax</h2><p>Calculate take-home pay after tax and Medicare.</p><span class="cta">Calculate &rarr;</span></a>
      
      <a href="/tools/uk-dividend-tax-calculator" class="card"><div class="card-icon">📊</div><h2>UK Dividend Tax</h2><p>Estimate tax liability on UK dividend income.</p><span class="cta">Calculate &rarr;</span></a>
      
      <a href="/tools/us-roth-ira-calculator" class="card"><div class="card-icon">🛡️</div><h2>Roth IRA Growth</h2><p>Project tax-free retirement growth.</p><span class="cta">Calculate &rarr;</span></a>
      
      <a href="/tools/uk-rental-yield-calculator" class="card"><div class="card-icon">🔑</div><h2>UK Rental Yield</h2><p>Analyze buy-to-let property investments.</p><span class="cta">Calculate &rarr;</span></a>
      
      <a href="/tools/us-self-employed-health-insurance" class="card"><div class="card-icon">🩺</div><h2>Self-Employed Health Deduction</h2><p>See how much of your health premiums you can deduct.</p><span class="cta">Calculate &rarr;</span></a>
      
      <a href="/tools/us-mortgage-extra-payments" class="card"><div class="card-icon">⚡</div><h2>Mortgage with Extra Payments</h2><p>See how much time and interest you save.</p><span class="cta">Calculate &rarr;</span></a>


      <!-- CATEGORY 2: INSURANCE & REAL ESTATE -->
      <h2 class="category-title">Insurance & Real Estate</h2>

      <a href="/tools/life-insurance-needs-calculator" class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">🛡️</div>
        <h2>Life Insurance Needs (DIME)</h2>
        <p>Find out how much coverage your family needs.</p>
        <span class="cta">Calculate &rarr;</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/tools/auto-insurance-deductible-calculator" class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">🚗</div>
        <h2>Auto Insurance Deductible</h2>
        <p>See if a higher deductible is worth the savings.</p>
        <span class="cta">Calculate &rarr;</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/tools/home-closing-costs-calculator" class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">📝</div>
        <h2>Home Closing Costs</h2>
        <p>Estimate the hidden fees of buying a home.</p>
        <span class="cta">Calculate &rarr;</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/tools/airbnb-roi-calculator" class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">🔑</div>
        <h2>Airbnb / Rental ROI</h2>
        <p>Analyze the profitability of a rental investment.</p>
        <span class="cta">Calculate &rarr;</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/tools/us-property-tax-calculator" class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">🏘️</div>
        <h2>US Property Tax</h2>
        <p>Estimate your annual property tax bill.</p>
        <span class="cta">Calculate &rarr;</span>
      </a>

    </div>

  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .container { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 64px 16px; }
  
  .hero { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 48px; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #111827; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.025em; }
  .hero p { font-size: 1.25rem; color: #4b5563; }
  
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; } }
  
  /* Category Header Styling */
  .category-title { 
    grid-column: 1 / -1; 
    font-size: 1.5rem; 
    color: #374151; 
    margin-top: 32px; 
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    padding-bottom: 12px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb;
  }

  .card { 
    display: block; 
    background: white; 
    padding: 24px; 
    border-radius: 12px; 
    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); 
    text-decoration: none; 
    color: inherit; 
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease; 
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; 
  }
  
  .card:hover { 
    transform: translateY(-4px); 
    box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); 
    border-color: #2563eb; 
  }
  
  .card-icon { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .card h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #1f2937; }
  .card p { color: #6b7280; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .cta { color: #2563eb; font-weight: 700; display: inline-block; font-size: 0.95rem; }
</style>
